{"seq":1,"slug":"the-error-correcting-revolution","title":"纠错码的革命","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/hamming-codes-legacy/the-error-correcting-revolution","wordCount":2116,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"纠错码的革命\">纠错码的革命</h1><p>理查德·汉明（Richard Hamming）1950 年发表于《贝尔系统技术杂志》（Bell System Technical Journal）第 29 卷第 2 期、第 147–160 页的论文《检错与纠错码》（&quot;Error Detecting and Error Correcting Codes&quot;），第一次给出了能<strong>自动定位并纠正</strong>单个比特错误的实用编码方法，开创了一个全新学科——编码理论（coding theory）。本篇聚焦这项工作的<strong>起源、数学构造与历史地位</strong>；其落地应用见同章 <a href=\"applications\">广泛的应用</a>，更技术化的码字推导见跨 hub 的 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/error-correcting-codes/hamming-code\">汉明码</a>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：Hamming, R. W. (1950). &quot;Error Detecting and Error Correcting Codes.&quot; <em>Bell System Technical Journal</em> 29(2): 147–160. <a href=\"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/j.1538-7305.1950.tb00463.x\">https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/j.1538-7305.1950.tb00463.x</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>称 1950 年那篇论文为&quot;革命&quot;，依据不在它解决了多少工程问题，而在它重置了三个认知：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>冗余的角色被改写</strong>：奇偶校验的冗余只换来&quot;知道出错了&quot;；汉明让每个校验位参与编码&quot;错在哪一位&quot;的地址，冗余从报警器变成了定位器。</li>\n<li><strong>纠错能力可以被度量</strong>：能纠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 位错要求任意两码字最小距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\ge 2t+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。这一判据把&quot;纠错&quot;从个案技巧变成了可设计、可比较的数学对象。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;存在&quot;被升级为&quot;可构造&quot;</strong>：香农 1948 年的信道编码定理证明了好码存在，汉明造出了第一个能用的，补上了从存在性到构造性的关键一环。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三个认知共同解释了它为何催生了一门独立学科，而非停留在工程小技巧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"起源-被周末机器逼出来的发明\">起源：被周末机器逼出来的发明</h2><p>1947 年前后，汉明在贝尔实验室使用一台基于继电器的 Bell Model V 计算机。机器在无人值守的周末批处理时一旦检测到错误，就直接放弃整批作业、停机等待。汉明的回忆是著名的——&quot;如果机器能侦测到错误，为什么不能定位错误的位置、进而把它纠正过来？&quot;（&quot;If it can detect the error, why can&#39;t it correct it?&quot;）正是这种<strong>对效率的愤怒</strong>催生了纠错码。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>汉明之前（奇偶校验时代）</th>\n<th>汉明码之后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错误处理能力</td>\n<td>仅能&quot;检测&quot;单比特错误</td>\n<td>检测 <strong>并定位、纠正</strong>单比特错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出错后的动作</td>\n<td>重传 / 重算 / 停机</td>\n<td>接收端<strong>就地自动修复</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冗余利用</td>\n<td>1 个校验位只换来&quot;知道出错&quot;</td>\n<td>多个校验位换来&quot;知道错在哪一位&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学科地位</td>\n<td>工程小技巧</td>\n<td>催生独立学科：编码理论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条历史线索与汉明的早期计算经历相互印证，详见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/computing-foundations/early-computing\">早期计算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心数学-用校验位的-地址-定位错误\">核心数学：用校验位的&quot;地址&quot;定位错误</h2><p>汉明的关键洞见是：不要让每个校验位只回答&quot;是/否出错&quot;，而要让若干校验位<strong>联合编码出错误的二进制地址</strong>。以经典的 (7,4) 汉明码为例——7 个传输位中 4 位是数据、3 位是校验：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>把比特位置编号 1–7，凡是位置编号为 2 的幂（1、2、4）的位作为校验位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1, p_2, p_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li>校验位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 负责&quot;位置编号二进制展开中第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 位为 1&quot;的所有位的偶校验；</li>\n<li>接收端重算三个校验，把三个校验结果按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_3 p_2 p_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 拼成一个 3 位二进制数，这个数就是<strong>出错位的位置</strong>（即&quot;症状&quot;/syndrome）；若为 0 则无错。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>校验位数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 与数据位数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 必须满足覆盖所有&quot;无错 + 单错&quot;情形的不等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></msup><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^r \\ge k + r + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8504em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>(7,4) 码中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=3, k=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3 = 8 \\ge 4+3+1 = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 恰好取等——这意味着它把冗余用到了极致，是一个<strong>完美码</strong>（perfect code）。后来人们增加一位总体校验得到 (8,4) 扩展汉明码，即可&quot;纠一检二&quot;（SECDED：single-error-correct, double-error-detect）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;4 位数据&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;编码器&lt;br/&gt;插入 p1 p2 p3&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;7 位码字&lt;br/&gt;经过有噪信道&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;接收端重算校验&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;syndrome&lt;br/&gt;= 0 ?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[&quot;无错,取出数据&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[&quot;syndrome 即出错位置&lt;br/&gt;翻转该位 → 自动纠正&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"4 位数据\"] --&gt; B[\"编码器&lt;br/&gt;插入 p1 p2 p3\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"7 位码字&lt;br/&gt;经过有噪信道\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"接收端重算校验\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"syndrome&lt;br/&gt;= 0 ?\"}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[\"无错,取出数据\"]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[\"syndrome 即出错位置&lt;br/&gt;翻转该位 → 自动纠正\"]</pre><p>这里还隐含了一个统一全编码理论的概念——<strong>汉明距离</strong>（两个码字不同比特的个数）。能纠正 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个错误，要求任意两码字的最小距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\ge 2t+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。(7,4) 码的最小距离为 3，故能纠 1 错。汉明距离的系统讨论见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/error-correcting-codes/hamming-distance\">汉明距离</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是-革命-而非-改良\">为什么是&quot;革命&quot;而非&quot;改良&quot;</h2><p>把汉明码称为革命，关键在于它改变了人们对&quot;冗余&quot;的根本认知。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>从被动到主动</strong>：奇偶校验是&quot;事后报警&quot;，汉明码是&quot;事中自愈&quot;，第一次让通信/存储系统具备了内生的可靠性，而非依赖重传协议。</li>\n<li><strong>从技巧到理论</strong>：汉明把一个工程问题抽象成了几何问题（码字是高维空间中互相隔开的点），为香农（Claude Shannon）1948 年信道编码定理给出的&quot;存在性&quot;承诺，提供了第一个<strong>可构造的存在证明</strong>。香农证明了好码&quot;存在&quot;，汉明造出了第一个能用的。</li>\n<li><strong>从孤例到学科</strong>：此后里德-穆勒码（Reed–Muller, 1954）、BCH 码（1959–60）、里德-所罗门码（Reed–Solomon, 1960）、卷积码、乃至 1990 年代逼近香农极限的 Turbo 码与 LDPC 码，全部生长在汉明开辟的这块土地上。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"权衡与反模式\">权衡与反模式</h2><p>纠错不是免费的午餐，理解其代价才能理解为何它没有&quot;一统天下、处处使用&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>权衡维度</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>反模式（常见误用）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>码率 vs 纠错力</td>\n<td>(7,4) 码率约 0.57，43% 带宽用于冗余</td>\n<td>在低噪声链路盲目堆叠强码，浪费带宽与功耗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纠错 vs 检错</td>\n<td>纠错需要更大最小距离，成本更高</td>\n<td>在可廉价重传的场景（如 TCP）硬上纠错码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>块码 vs 流式</td>\n<td>汉明码是固定块码，不适合突发错误</td>\n<td>用单纠错块码对抗&quot;成串&quot;突发错误，应改用 RS 码或加交织</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个被反复证明的工程教训是：<strong>纠错码必须匹配信道的错误模型</strong>。汉明码对&quot;随机、稀疏的单比特错&quot;近乎完美，对&quot;成片烧毁&quot;的突发错则几乎无能为力——这正是深空通信改用里德-所罗门码、磁盘改用交织 + RS 的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原创综合-汉明码的-奠基者悖论\">原创综合：汉明码的&quot;奠基者悖论&quot;</h2><p>汉明码今天很少被<strong>单独</strong>部署——现代系统要么用更强的 RS/LDPC，要么用扩展汉明（SECDED）做内存这种&quot;错误极稀疏&quot;的场景。但这并不削弱它的地位，反而揭示了一种&quot;奠基者悖论&quot;：真正的奠基性工作，其价值不在于自身被永久使用，而在于它<strong>定义了后人思考问题的框架</strong>。今天每一个谈论码率、最小距离、syndrome 解码的人，都在使用汉明 1950 年立下的语言。这与汉明本人对&quot;重要工作&quot;的看法一脉相承——做能开启一整个方向的问题，而非只解决一道孤立的题（见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/the-importance-of-problems/working-on-important-problems\">研究重要问题</a>）。</p>\n<p>正因如此，IEEE 在 1988 年设立的最高信息科学奖项直接以他命名为&quot;IEEE 理查德·汉明奖章&quot;（IEEE Richard W. Hamming Medal），汉明本人是首位得主。这枚奖章与汉明 1968 年获得的图灵奖（见 <a href=\"../../major-works/turing-award/the-turing-award\">图灵奖的荣誉</a>）共同确认：纠错码不是一项技术，而是一个时代的基石。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：IEEE Richard W. Hamming Medal, Wikipedia. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEEE_Richard_W._Hamming_Medal\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEEE_Richard_W._Hamming_Medal</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>1950 年 4 月发表于《贝尔系统技术杂志》的《检错与纠错码》，第一次给出能自动定位并纠正单比特错的实用编码方法，开创了编码理论。</li>\n<li>起源是被继电器计算机在周末无人值守时因单错停机、整批作业作废的挫折，汉明由此追问&quot;既然能检错为何不能纠错&quot;。</li>\n<li>核心构造是用校验位联合编码出错位置的二进制地址，(7,4) 码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3 = 8 = 4+3+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 恰好取等，是一个完美码；加一位即得 (8,4) 扩展汉明码，可纠一检二。</li>\n<li>它被称为革命的三重理由：纠错能力可度量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\ge 2t+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）、把香农的存在性承诺变成可构造、并开启了 Reed-Muller、BCH、RS 直至 LDPC 的整个家族。</li>\n<li>代价是码率与纠错力的权衡；纠错码必须匹配信道的错误模型，汉明码对随机单点错近乎完美，对突发错几乎无能为力。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"纠错码的革命","id":"纠错码的革命"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"起源：被周末机器逼出来的发明","id":"起源-被周末机器逼出来的发明"},{"level":2,"text":"核心数学：用校验位的\"地址\"定位错误","id":"核心数学-用校验位的-地址-定位错误"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是\"革命\"而非\"改良\"","id":"为什么是-革命-而非-改良"},{"level":2,"text":"权衡与反模式","id":"权衡与反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"原创综合：汉明码的\"奠基者悖论\"","id":"原创综合-汉明码的-奠基者悖论"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"广泛的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/hamming-codes-legacy/applications"}}